Error: Jet.EveryFieldMissed: Function `wrong_struct` never reads stored field `total` of `Order`
  --> Tests/UI/every_field_unrelated_destructure.jet:19:1
    |
 19 | wrong_struct: fn(order: Order, other: Other) -> Int {
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  --> Tests/UI/every_field_unrelated_destructure.jet:18:1
    |
 18 | #EveryField(of: Order)
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this `#EveryField` marker
 Why: `#EveryField(of: Order)` requires the body to directly read every stored field of `Order` — plain writes, `..` rest patterns, `_` discards, and passing the whole value to another function do not count
 Fix: Read `total` on `Order` in `wrong_struct`, or remove `#EveryField(of: Order)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.EveryFieldMissed

